  "precommitted_interpretation_checks": [
    "Reported Q2 net loss -4.3 and Q3 net income +3.2 USD billion are release-rounded; the displayed-value swing +7.5 is not a constant-scope organic earnings improvement because Discover closed May 18 and Q2 includes an 8.767 USD-billion initial allowance build for Discover non-PCD loans.",
    "Provision for credit losses falls 11.4 to 2.7 USD billion, while net charge-offs rise 3.1 to 3.5. The signed loan-reserve movement changes from a +7.9 billion build to a -0.760 billion release. Thus lower provision must not be misreported as lower realized charge-offs.",
    "Pre-provision earnings rise 5.5 to 7.1 USD billion, but the Q2/Q3 scope differs due to partial/full Discover inclusion. No organic growth rate or acquisition-adjusted trend is established by these two release summaries.",
